E
tome~
As you gaze upon the pages, the writing seems to come alive!
A magical force grabs ahold of your spirit, and pulls it free.
Terrified, you attempt to fight, but it is futile to resist.
However, as your spirit rushes into the tome, you feel at ease.
No harm was meant to you; it is simply easier for the tome to
communicate in this fashion.
~
